---
// ComingSoonFooter.astro - Modern 2026 Minimal Footer
---

<footer class="w-full py-8 sm:py-12 px-4 sm:px-8 border-t border-white/[0.08] relative z-20 mt-auto safe-bottom bg-[#050811]/90 backdrop-blur-xl">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-center sm:text-left">
    <!-- Brand Info -->
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-white p-0.5 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
          <img src="/images/sct-logo-transparent.png" alt="Logo" class="w-full h-full object-contain" onerror="this.src='/sct-logo.jpg'" />
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-heading text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wider text-white font-bold">
          SHREE CHOWDESHWARI TOURS & TRAVELS
        </h4>
      </div>
      <p class="font-signature text-xl text-amber-300">
        Journeys with Divine Blessings
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright & Legal -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:items-end gap-2 text-[11px] font-sans text-slate-400">
      <p>© 2026 Shree Chowdeshwari Tours & Travels. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-end gap-4 text-amber-400 font-medium">
        <button type="button" class="hover:text-white transition-colors trigger-notify-modal">Inaugural Privileges</button>
        <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
        <button type="button" class="hover:text-white transition-colors trigger-notify-modal">VIP Guestlist</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
